# Panel Shop Demo Guide

This guide is for running a live demo of the static B&M panel shop prototype. It assumes the demo is open at `index.html` or a served URL such as `http://127.0.0.1:8765/panel-demo/index.html`.

The demo is local only. Badge sign-in is cosmetic, all records are fabricated, and nothing is sent to a server.

## Presenter Setup

Open the bench and the wall board in two windows:

- Bench: `index.html`
- Floor board: `board.html`

Use the same browser profile for both windows so the board receives bench updates through browser storage. If you are serving the folder locally, keep the `/panel-demo/` path when testing GitHub Pages-style routing.

Before a clean run, click **Reset demo** on the sign-in screen. Reset restores the seeded panels and signs out. Generated serial and work-order counters keep their high-water marks in the same browser data so numbers are not reused.

